        {
          "text": "Ngaaya majwi aa-Amosi, umwi wabeembeli baku-Tekowa, ngaakasinsima aa-Israyeli kuciindi ca-Uziya mwami wa-Juda, akuciindi ca­-Jeroboamu mwana wa-Joasi mwami wa-Israyeli, myaka yobile muzuzumo wanyika kutana kuba. ",
