        {
          "text": "Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova. Nkaambo kamilandu yotatwe yaDamasko, ee ncobeni yone, nsikooyoobapilusizya luumo. Nkaambo bakavwimbula Gileadi azipozyo zibosya zyabutale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
