        {
          "text": "Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova, Nkaambo kamilandu yotatwe yaGaza, ee ncobeni yone, nsikooyoobapilusizya luumo. Nkaambo bakatola cisi coonse mubuzike akubaaba mumaanza aaba-Edomu, ",
