              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela njoomanya mweendelezi waku-Asidodi asikujata mumfunko wakuAsikeloni, alimwi ijanza lyangu njoolyuumya Ekroni, aba-Filisti boonse basyeede bayoonyonyooka, mbwaamba Mwami Jehova.",
          "type": "text",
